## 5. Note 1: line 110 against line 99 and rule 2
$ sed -n 99p docs/proposals/H34_DESIGN.md; sed -n 108p docs/proposals/H34_DESIGN.md; sed -n 110p docs/proposals/H34_DESIGN.md
  - Mixed commits, a decision, a supersession, a CHANGES or a QUESTION: all delivered at once.
  2. Any entry the role does get carries every held entry before it, on any item, in id order. The cursor moves one entry at a time, as today. When a 30-minute hold ends, every held entry goes in that same wake.
- Entries after a held one wait with it. An fyi for another session is passed over, but the cursor doesn't move past it while a held one sits before it.

